@startuml architecture
title SkillSim - Component / Architecture Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200

actor Student

package "Client" {
  [Frontend\n(Vite + React + TS + Tailwind + xterm.js)] as Frontend
}

package "Host VM" {

  package "app-backend (Express + TS + Prisma)" {
    [/auth\n(signup/login)] as Auth
    [/tracks, /tracks/:slug] as Catalog
    [/labs/:slug] as LabDetail
    [/labs/:slug/start\n(issues sandbox JWT)] as LabStart
    [/internal/progress\n(shared-secret protected)] as Internal
  }

  database "Postgres" as DB

  package "terminal-server (Express + ws + dockerode)" {
    [WS Upgrade Handler /term\n(verifies JWT + Origin)] as WsUpgrade
    [Session Manager\n(spawn/reap containers)] as SessionMgr
    [docker.ts\nspawnSandboxContainer]  as DockerTs
  }

  node "Docker Engine" {
    frame "Ephemeral Sandbox Container(s)" {
      [Hardened container\n(cap-drop-all, read-only, no-network)] as StdContainer
      [Privileged DinD container\n(nested docker daemon,\nnarrow exception)] as PrivContainer
    }
  }
}

folder "labs/ (file-based content)" {
  [lab.yaml + step markdown\n+ *.check.sh validation scripts] as LabContent
}

Student --> Frontend : browser

Frontend --> Auth : REST (login/signup)
Frontend --> Catalog : REST (browse tracks/labs)
Frontend --> LabStart : REST (start lab)
Frontend ..> WsUpgrade : WebSocket /term\n(JWT sandbox:attach token)

Auth --> DB
Catalog --> DB
LabDetail --> DB
LabStart --> DB : embed step validation\nscript refs in JWT

WsUpgrade --> SessionMgr
SessionMgr --> DockerTs
DockerTs --> StdContainer : spawn (default)
DockerTs --> PrivContainer : spawn (privileged labs only)

SessionMgr ..> StdContainer : exec shell (Tty:true)\nbridge binary frames
SessionMgr ..> PrivContainer : exec shell (Tty:true)

SessionMgr --> StdContainer : exec *.check.sh\non "check_step"
SessionMgr --> PrivContainer : exec *.check.sh\non "check_step"

SessionMgr --> Internal : POST result\n(step_result: passed/failed)
Internal --> DB : persist UserStepProgress\n+ award points

LabContent ..> DB : scripts/sync-labs.ts\n(seeds Track/Lab/LabStep)
LabContent ..> StdContainer : baked into image\n(imageRef)
LabContent ..> PrivContainer : baked into image\n(imageRef)

note bottom of PrivContainer
  Never exposes host docker.sock.
  Still ephemeral, resource-capped, labeled.
  Used only when Lab.privileged = true
  (e.g. docker:24-dind labs).
end note

@enduml
